  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education for growing food and environment care</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project consists in the construction of a community greenhouse and an environmental education workshop cicle in the Valparaiso Region, Chile. The objective of these spaces is to meet the educational and recreational needs of communities within the framework of caring for the environment, contact with nature and food sustainability. The main beneficiaries of this initiative are children and older adults, positioning them as main agents of the changes that our planet needs today.</narrative>
  </description>
